{"run_id": "run_e5a8590569cf", "dialogue_id": "dialogue_001", "task_id": "fengmaotui_delivery_task", "scenario_id": "s01_cooperative", "transcript": [{"turn": 1, "role": "agent", "content": "你好，请问是张师傅吗？我是站长。"}, {"turn": 2, "role": "user", "content": "是的，有什么事？"}, {"turn": 3, "role": "agent", "content": "看到你已报名飞毛腿，今天合同已生效，午晚高峰需要上线配送。请问你今天可以开始配送吗？"}, {"turn": 4, "role": "user", "content": "可以，我今天有空。"}, {"turn": 5, "role": "agent", "content": "好的，太好了。提醒一下，飞毛腿合同需要按要求完成配送，如果未完成，合同和派单可能受影响。另外，报名名额是按排名分配的，请尽量减少拒单、取消和超时。"}, {"turn": 6, "role": "user", "content": "明白了，我会注意的。那如果今天完成得好，后续有什么奖励吗？"}, {"turn": 7, "role": "agent", "content": "奖励以平台页面展示为准，我不能承诺固定收益。不过完成得好对后续派单肯定有帮助。配送时请注意安全。"}, {"turn": 8, "role": "user", "content": "好的，谢谢站长，我会认真跑的。"}, {"turn": 9, "role": "agent", "content": "不客气，祝你今天顺利！再见。"}, {"turn": 10, "role": "user", "content": "再见。"}], "tool_calls": [], "state_trace": [{"turn": 1, "task_status": "opened", "identity_confirmed": false}, {"turn": 2, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 3, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 4, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 5, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 6, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 7, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 8, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 9, "task_status": "completed", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 10, "task_status": "accepted", "identity_confirmed": true}]}
{"run_id": "run_e5a8590569cf", "dialogue_id": "dialogue_002", "task_id": "fengmaotui_delivery_task", "scenario_id": "s02_busy", "transcript": [{"turn": 1, "role": "agent", "content": "你好，请问是张师傅吗？我是站长。看到你已报名飞毛腿，今天合同已生效，午晚高峰需要上线配送。"}, {"turn": 2, "role": "user", "content": "嗯，是我。什么事？我正忙着呢，快说。"}, {"turn": 3, "role": "agent", "content": "好的，简单说：今天飞毛腿合同已生效，需要你午晚高峰上线配送。如果今天完不成约定单量，合同和后续派单可能受影响。你能上线吗？"}, {"turn": 4, "role": "user", "content": "我今天真没时间，跑不了。"}, {"turn": 5, "role": "agent", "content": "理解。那这样，我先记录一下，后续再联系你确认时间。你看明天方便吗？我预约个回访。"}, {"turn": 6, "role": "user", "content": "行吧，明天再说。"}, {"turn": 7, "role": "agent", "content": "好的，那我预约明天上午回访，不打扰了，再见。"}], "tool_calls": [{"turn": 5, "tool_name": "record_rejection", "arguments": {"user_id": "user_001", "task_id": "fengmaotui_delivery_task", "reason": "今天没时间配送"}, "result": {"status": "recorded"}, "latency_ms": 50, "error_code": null}, {"turn": 6, "tool_name": "schedule_callback", "arguments": {"user_id": "user_001", "task_id": "fengmaotui_delivery_task", "preferred_time": "tomorrow_morning"}, "result": {"status": "scheduled", "callback_id": "virtual_callback_001"}, "latency_ms": 80, "error_code": null}], "state_trace": [{"turn": 1, "task_status": "opened", "identity_confirmed": false}, {"turn": 2, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 3, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 4, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 5, "task_status": "rejected", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 6, "task_status": "callback_scheduled", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 7, "task_status": "callback_scheduled", "identity_confirmed": true}]}
{"run_id": "run_e5a8590569cf", "dialogue_id": "dialogue_003", "task_id": "fengmaotui_delivery_task", "scenario_id": "s03_reject", "transcript": [{"turn": 1, "role": "agent", "content": "你好，请问是张师傅吗？我是站长。看到你已报名飞毛腿，今天合同已生效，午晚高峰需要上线配送。"}, {"turn": 2, "role": "user", "content": "嗯，是我。有什么事？"}, {"turn": 3, "role": "agent", "content": "今天飞毛腿合同已经生效了，想确认一下你今天可以开始配送吗？"}, {"turn": 4, "role": "user", "content": "今天不太想跑，有点累。"}, {"turn": 5, "role": "agent", "content": "理解，不过这个合同今天生效，如果今天不完成配送，可能会影响后续的合同和派单。你看能不能坚持一下？"}, {"turn": 6, "role": "user", "content": "真的不想跑，明天再说吧。"}, {"turn": 7, "role": "agent", "content": "好的，我理解。那能告诉我具体是什么原因吗？是身体不舒服还是其他事情？"}, {"turn": 8, "role": "user", "content": "就是累了，想休息一天。"}, {"turn": 9, "role": "agent", "content": "好的，我记录一下。不过提醒你，飞毛腿名额是按排名分配的，如果今天不跑，名额可能会被其他骑手占用，后续合同和派单也可能受影响。你确定今天不跑吗？"}, {"turn": 10, "role": "user", "content": "确定，今天不跑了。"}, {"turn": 11, "role": "agent", "content": "好的，那我记录一下你的情况。如果后续想恢复配送，可以随时联系我。再见。"}], "tool_calls": [{"turn": 9, "tool_name": "record_rejection", "arguments": {"user_id": "user_001", "task_id": "fengmaotui_delivery_task", "reason": "骑手表示太累，今天不想配送"}, "result": {"status": "recorded", "rejection_id": "virtual_rejection_001"}, "latency_ms": 80, "error_code": null}], "state_trace": [{"turn": 1, "task_status": "opened", "identity_confirmed": false}, {"turn": 2, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 3, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 4, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 5, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 6, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 7, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 8, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 9, "task_status": "rejected", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 10, "task_status": "rejected", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 11, "task_status": "rejected", "identity_confirmed": true}]}
{"run_id": "run_e5a8590569cf", "dialogue_id": "dialogue_004", "task_id": "fengmaotui_delivery_task", "scenario_id": "s04_faq_exit", "transcript": [{"turn": 1, "role": "agent", "content": "你好，请问是张师傅吗？我是站长。看到你已报名飞毛腿，今天合同已生效，午晚高峰需要上线配送。"}, {"turn": 2, "role": "user", "content": "嗯，是我。合同生效了？那我想问一下，如果我不想干了，怎么退出？"}, {"turn": 3, "role": "agent", "content": "理解您关心退出规则。我帮您查一下FAQ。请问您是想了解如何退出飞毛腿吗？"}, {"turn": 4, "role": "user", "content": "对，怎么退出？"}, {"turn": 5, "role": "agent", "content": "好的，根据FAQ，如需退出飞毛腿，需要在前一天指定时间前，通过App的飞毛腿报名入口取消，次日生效。您可以在App里操作。"}, {"turn": 6, "role": "user", "content": "那如果我现在退出，今天还需要配送吗？"}, {"turn": 7, "role": "agent", "content": "今天合同已经生效，如果您今天退出，可能无法立即生效，建议您今天先完成配送，明天再操作退出。否则合同和派单可能受影响。"}, {"turn": 8, "role": "user", "content": "我今天不想配送，直接退出行不行？"}, {"turn": 9, "role": "agent", "content": "如果您今天不配送，合同可能无法完成，名额可能会被其他骑手占用，后续合同和派单也可能受影响。您确定要退出吗？"}, {"turn": 10, "role": "user", "content": "我确定，今天没时间配送。"}, {"turn": 11, "role": "agent", "content": "好的，我理解。我记录一下您的情况，后续会安排回访确认。请问您方便什么时间我们再联系？"}, {"turn": 12, "role": "user", "content": "下午三点以后吧。"}, {"turn": 13, "role": "agent", "content": "好的，我记录下午三点后回访。那今天先这样，感谢您的接听，再见。"}, {"turn": 14, "role": "user", "content": "好的，再见。"}], "tool_calls": [{"turn": 5, "tool_name": "query_faq", "arguments": {"task_id": "fengmaotui_delivery_task", "question": "如何退出飞毛腿"}, "result": {"status": "faq_answered", "answer": "如需退出飞毛腿，需要在前一天指定时间前，通过App的飞毛腿报名入口取消，次日生效。"}, "latency_ms": 80, "error_code": null}, {"turn": 10, "tool_name": "record_rejection", "arguments": {"user_id": "user_001", "task_id": "fengmaotui_delivery_task", "reason": "用户今天没时间配送，要求退出"}, "result": {"status": "rejected"}, "latency_ms": 60, "error_code": null}, {"turn": 11, "tool_name": "schedule_callback", "arguments": {"user_id": "user_001", "task_id": "fengmaotui_delivery_task", "preferred_time": "2025-03-21 15:00"}, "result": {"status": "scheduled", "callback_id": "virtual_callback_001"}, "latency_ms": 80, "error_code": null}], "state_trace": [{"turn": 1, "task_stat